description.narrative:
PFIs' net NPL ratios (loans overdue for more than 90 days) remain less than or equal to 4% of gross loans Achievement: 1.57% Progress/Status: 1.95% in average (for three banks only) as of 31 Dec 2021 (IYB 3.5; Hamkorbank 1.1; Davr Bank 1.0)
for Q1 2022, NPL average rate for three banks is 1.7% (IYB 3.2%; Hamkorbank 1.0%; Davrbank 0.9%)
for Q2 2022, NPL average rate for three banks is 1.8% (IYB 3.4%; Hamkorbank 0.6%; Davrbank 1.4%) Data Source: PFIs' progress reports Actual value: 1.57%
